WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A client signs. Give the kickoff a clear next step.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Capture the client, service, goal and context in one intake.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Turn those details into a project brief your team can review.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Confirm the scope, approval owner and access before moving forward.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Seven assigned tasks. Clear dates. Work unlocks as prerequisites finish.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Copy a welcome draft that carries the goal and next steps forward.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Download the handover and export the assigned task list.
